	(text "MLPF-WB55-01E3: impedance match to STM32WB55Cx plus harmonic filter, 50 ohm on the antenna side (DS12804 p.1).\nPlace it at RF1 with short tracks; >= 2 ground vias per GND pad, straight to L2 (rf-layout 3).\nR501 (0 ohm) and C501/C502 (not fitted): pi network to tune the antenna on the finished board with a VNA.\nAntenna: TI SWRA117D inverted-F, designed for a 50 ohm feed; copper only. Keep all layers clear under it.\nASSUMPTION: the board's stack-up detunes it; retune with C501/C502 and the antenna length (SWRA117D).\nRF_50R, RF_ANT: grounded coplanar 50 ohm on L1 over solid L2 (class RF_50; width from JLCPCB's calculator)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
